  "translation": "Na Yoas, king bilong Yisrael, i salim tok i go long Amatsiahu, king bilong Yehuda, i tok olsem: Diwai kakaruk i stap long Lebanan i salim tok i go long seda i stap long Lebanan, i tok olsem: Givim ⟨את⟩ pikinini meri bilong yu long pikinini man bilong mi bilong marit. Tasol wanpela ol animal bilong bus i stap long Lebanan i wokabaut i kamap na i putim ⟨את⟩ diwai kakaruk aniap long graun.",
